{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27042","headline":"心怀霜 · 姚合","name":"心怀霜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲识爲诗苦，秋霜若在心。\n神清方耿耿，气肃觉沈沈。\n皓素中方委，严凝得更深。\n依稀轻夕渚，髣髴在寒林。\n思劲凄孤韵，声酸激冷吟。\n还如饮冰士，励节望知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}